<div class="info">
<h2> About the Movie</h2>

<p>
<strong>Swapped</strong> is a 2026 animated fantasy adventure
comedy about two very different creatures who suddenly
experience an unusual body swap.
</p>

<p>
The story follows a small woodland creature named
<strong>Ollie</strong> and a majestic bird named
<strong>Ivy</strong>. They are natural enemies of the Valley,
but a magical event causes them to swap bodies.
</p>

<p>
Because they are trapped in each other's bodies, Ollie and Ivy
must learn to understand one another and work together.
Their adventure becomes a journey filled with comedy,
friendship, teamwork, and exciting challenges.
</p>
</div>

<div class="characters">
<h2> Main Characters</h2>

<ul>
<li><strong>Ollie</strong> – A small woodland creature voiced by Michael B. Jordan.</li>
<li><strong>Ivy</strong> – A majestic bird voiced by Juno Temple.</li>
<li><strong>Boogle</strong> – A character voiced by Tracy Morgan.</li>
<li><strong>Caloo</strong> – A character voiced by Cedric the Entertainer.</li>
<li><strong>Calli</strong> – A character voiced by Justina Machado.</li>
</ul>
</div>

<div class="details">
<h2> Movie Details</h2>

<ul>
<li><strong>Title:</strong> Swapped</li>
<li><strong>Year:</strong> 2026</li>
<li><strong>Release Date:</strong> May 1, 2026</li>
<li><strong>Genre:</strong> Animation, Comedy, Family, Adventure</li>
<li><strong>Director:</strong> Nathan Greno</li>
<li><strong>Studio:</strong> Skydance Animation</li>
<li><strong>Distributor:</strong> Netflix</li>
<li><strong>Runtime:</strong> Approximately 102 minutes</li>
<li><strong>Language:</strong> English</li>
</ul>
</div>

<div class="info">
<h2> What Makes Swapped Interesting?</h2>

<p>
The movie combines humor, fantasy, adventure, and friendship
into an entertaining story. The body-swap concept allows
Ollie and Ivy to see the world from each other's perspective
and learn the importance of understanding and teamwork.
</p>
